repository-code: https://github.com/MSKazemi/agent-fleet
url: https://mskazemi.com/agent-fleet/
abstract: >-
  A resource-aware orchestrator that runs many Claude Code sessions in parallel
  against one shared task queue. Concurrency is derived from the work and from
  what the host machine can actually spare, rather than from the queue length.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - claude-code
  - parallel-execution
  - task-queue
  - resource-aware-scheduling
  - browser-automation
